        <headline>Coastal Flood Advisory issued September 25 at 11:01AM EDT until September 26 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Minor coastal flooding.

* WHERE...St Johns River Basin.

* WHEN...Until 8 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Flooding of lots, parks, and roads with only
isolated road closures expected.
</description>
        <instruction>If travel is required, allow extra time as some roads may be
closed. Do not drive around barricades or through water of
unknown depth. Take the necessary actions to protect flood-prone
property.</instruction>
